      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Moreland%2C_Georgia",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Author Erskine Caldwell, famed for “Tobacco Road,” was born in a wooded house outside Moreland in 1903.",
